{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>油麻地發生墮物傷人事件。今日（14日）晚上8時11分，砵蘭街與咸美頓街交界，據報突有瓷器從天而降墮地，一名女子猝不及防，被碎片擊傷右邊小腿，當</p><p>消息稱，傷者38歲，持雙程證，當時她與一名男性友人途經上址；事後現場遺下大灘血漬，警方正調查事件。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131703345153839104753604.jpeg/aG3Tr8vYqVJRbvZz2xo9tDY2EtM6dFMxDuffZyfn32c\" alt=\"警員封鎖現場調查。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>警員封鎖現場調查。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131703353429200896894367.jpeg/jGbh4tNTs8x-HsmViszPvTtfmYudNqJ4cCc4IVknOCE\" alt=\"大批警員在場調查。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>大批警員在場調查。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131703346688692224285697.jpeg/abzTlJP9nEjTmZqw39UNGhKHU5zUX7B1I65eVAquXlQ\" alt=\"現場遺下大灘血漬，警員封鎖現場調查。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>現場遺下大灘血漬，警員封鎖現場調查。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131703338392358912064135.jpeg/j_OVGnh0V1khG502jO17_LXNnUQoVvPPhioizK8qIsw\" alt=\"現場遺下大灘血漬。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>現場遺下大灘血漬。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131703357065793536035829.jpeg/cW8AjWXv5TtDbL6NcaMtbaz0j6ggolh3XxRFZHYURWQ\" alt=\"據報有瓷器從天而降墮地，碎片四散。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>據報有瓷器從天而降墮地，碎片四散。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131703349134364672213405.jpeg/aavLxaPbibOSM4KRRJkooikjyU8-Wa0GlDJjcb0yY3E\" alt=\"現場遺下大灘血漬，警員封鎖現場調查。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>現場遺下大灘血漬，警員封鎖現場調查。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131703359943217152029487.jpeg/zfMyXCejh1sbEL6Wq-uc8KcGICfgVLcK4X7ipsh-4qY\" alt=\"據報有瓷器從天而降墮地，碎片四散。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>據報有瓷器從天而降墮地，碎片四散。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131703341840207872961547.jpeg/ycL-6w5nl3vBvdNiZzvtP0-q17x7d2wzDfskhA37JIQ\" alt=\"現場為油麻地砵蘭街與咸美頓街交界。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>現場為油麻地砵蘭街與咸美頓街交界。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131703349817774080701964.jpeg/-x_CglOvlAQfVDMaU-MUeLugWYmK-HtLo7khcIq5IXA\" alt=\"大批警員在場調查。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>大批警員在場調查。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T15:17:00.334223+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}